{"ref":"BDB, מַתַּת²","hw":"מַתַּת²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מַתַּת</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <em>gift;</em>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתָּ֑ת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.7\">1 K 13:7</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.14\">Pr 25:14</a> + 4 times;—<em>gift</em> = reward <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.7\">1 K 13:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַתַּת יָדוֹ</span> <em>the gift of his hand</em>, i.e. of his power, what he is able to give <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.5\">Ez 46:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.11\">11</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מַתָּנָה\" href=\"/BDB,_מַתָּנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">מַתָּנָה</a> and <a data-ref=\"BDB, יָד\" href=\"/BDB,_יָד\", dir=\"rtl\">יָד</a> <strong>2</strong>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:13\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.13\">Ec 3:13</a> <em>the gift of God</em> (of the enjoyment of man), so <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:18\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.18\">5:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שָׁ֑קֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.14\">Pr 25:14</a> <em>a gift of falsity</em>, i.e. one promised and not given.","next":"BDB, מַתַּנְיָ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, מַתְּנַי"}